{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-06-01 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT EXPANDS AUTONOMOUS DRIVING TEST PORTFOLIO WITH LIDAR TARGET SIMULATOR', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #ADAS--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS) IS EXPANDING ITS AWARD-WINNING PORTFOLIO OF AUTONOMOUS DRIVING VALIDATION TEST SOLUTIONS WITH THE E8717A LIDAR TARGET SIMULATOR (LTS), WHICH ENABLES AUTOMAKERS AND LIDAR SENSOR MAKERS TO TEST AND VALIDATE LIDAR SENSORS FOR AUTONOMOUS VEHICLES (AV). INITIALLY DEVELOPED FOR USE IN METEOROLOGY AND TOPOGRAPHY, LIDAR IS NOW BEING ADOPTED AS AN AUTOMOTIVE SENSING TECHNOLOGY THAT ENABLES AVS TO “SEE” AND SAFELY NAVIGATE THRO.'}